 <212658678+luuoaoa@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 21:15:04 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Turn off Attribution Reporting and Shared Storage

Both Privacy Sandbox features default to enabled upstream, and both were only
off in colorburst because Chromium's field trial testing config happened to
disable them. We now opt out of that config, so the code default has to carry
it instead.
---
 components/attribution_reporting/features.cc | 6 +++++-
 services/network/public/cpp/features.cc      | 5 ++++-
 2 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/components/attribution_reporting/features.cc b/components/attribution_reporting/features.cc
index b199e7682a..b5153dd38e 100644
--- a/components/attribution_reporting/features.cc
+++ b/components/attribution_reporting/features.cc
@@ -9,6 +9,10 @@
 namespace attribution_reporting::features {
 
 // Controls whether the Conversion Measurement API infrastructure is enabled.
-BASE_FEATURE(kConversionMeasurement, base::FEATURE_ENABLED_BY_DEFAULT);
+// colorburst: off. This is ad attribution measurement; a de-Googled build has
+// no use for it, and upstream is deprecating it anyway. Chromium's checked-in
+// field trial config used to disable it for us as a side effect -- we opt out
+// of that config now, so the default has to say it.
+BASE_FEATURE(kConversionMeasurement, base::FEATURE_DISABLED_BY_DEFAULT);
 
 }  // namespace attribution_reporting::features
diff --git a/services/network/public/cpp/features.cc b/services/network/public/cpp/features.cc
index 460f10739f..d54b9602c6 100644
--- a/services/network/public/cpp/features.cc
+++ b/services/network/public/cpp/features.cc
@@ -429,7 +429,10 @@ BASE_FEATURE(kBrowsingTopics, base::FEATURE_ENABLED_BY_DEFAULT);
 // automatically expose this API to the web, it only allows the element to be
 // enabled by the runtime enabled feature, for origin trials.
 // https://github.com/pythagoraskitty/shared-storage/blob/main/README.md
-BASE_FEATURE(kSharedStorageAPI, base::FEATURE_ENABLED_BY_DEFAULT);
+// colorburst: off, for the same reason as kConversionMeasurement -- a Privacy
+// Sandbox surface upstream is deprecating, which the field trial testing config
+// happened to disable for us until we opted out of it.
+BASE_FEATURE(kSharedStorageAPI, base::FEATURE_DISABLED_BY_DEFAULT);
 BASE_FEATURE_PARAM(size_t,
                    kSharedStorageURLSelectionOperationInputURLSizeLimit,
                    &kSharedStorageAPI,
-- 
